{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"wheat_sheaf","model_identifier":"wheat_sheaf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## wheat_sheaf\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.5..6.5, y -1.0..5.0, z -19.0..20.0 (size 7.0 x 6.0 x 39.0 u = 20 x 17 x 110 cm).\nWheat sheaf: a ~1.1 m sheaf of golden stalks bound with a twist of straw, the bushy heads behind (+Z), carried on the shoulder. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.0.\n"},"description":"## wheat_sheaf\n\nCarried load, plants.\n\n- Cubes: 5 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -0.5..6.5, y -1.0..5.0, z -19.0..20.0 (size 7.0 x 6.0 x 39.0 u = 20 x 17 x 110 cm).\nWheat sheaf: a ~1.1 m sheaf of golden stalks bound with a twist of straw, the bushy heads behind (+Z), carried on the shoulder. Origin = **slot_shoulder_r** (top of the right shoulder): the load rests on the shoulder (bottom at y = 0) and lies along Z, balanced over the slot, its centre ~2.5 u outboard of the slot so it clears the head. To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 1.0.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stalks","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.5,0.0,-18.0],"to":[5.5,4.0,8.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,31,5.0,35.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[10,26,36.0,30.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[5,31,10.0,35.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[36,26,62.0,30.0],"textu